---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Baohua Fang">
  <section class="container-wide pt-20 pb-24 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-6">About</p>
    <h1 class="display-lg mb-10">
      From prose, to play.
    </h1>

    <div class="prose-custom text-[color:var(--color-ink-dim)] text-lg leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p>
        I'm Baohua (Arno) Fang, a Computer Engineering undergraduate at
        <span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">CUHK-Shenzhen</span>,
        and a prospective MS / MFA applicant for the 2026 cycle.
      </p>
      <p>
        I grew up wanting to be a writer. Through middle school I kept a literary
        blog at <a href="https://archive.hiddenblade.net" class="underline text-[color:var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-accent)]">hiddenblade.net</a>,
        publishing fiction, essays, and poetry. Films and games — Death Stranding chief among them —
        slowly made it clear that text alone could not hold the kind of spatial,
        interactive expression I wanted. So I crossed over.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work now sits at the intersection of <span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">systemic narrative design</span>,
        <span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">human-computer interaction</span>,
        and a stubborn engineering background (ACM Multimedia 2025 2nd author).
        I'm drawn to projects where the <em>mechanic itself</em> is the sentence —
        where playing a system is a way of being changed by it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Long-term, my goal is to expand the boundaries of what a game can be —
        to tell better stories, in forms that only interaction can hold.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rule mt-16 pt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-sm">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Skills</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-[color:var(--color-ink-dim)]">
          <li><span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Engines:</span> Unity, TouchDesigner, UE5</li>
          <li><span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Languages:</span> C#, Python, C++, JavaScript, Solidity</li>
          <li><span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Domains:</span> Systemic & Narrative Design, HCI Prototyping, AI Workflows</li>
          <li><span class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Languages spoken:</span> Mandarin (native), English (TOEFL 110, GRE 328)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Contact</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-[color:var(--color-ink-dim)]">
          <li>baohuafang@link.cuhk.edu.cn</li>
          <li><a class="underline hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]" href="https://github.com/Hidden61ade">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a class="underline hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]" href="https://hidden61ade.itch.io">itch.io</a></li>
          <li><a class="underline hover:text-[color:var(--color-ink)]" href="/cv.pdf">CV (PDF)</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
